# imo (https://imo.im/)

> imo is a global messaging app offering free voice and video calls, instant messaging, and media sharing, with a focus on user privacy and secure communication. With over 200 million users across 170+ countries and support for 62 languages, it works reliably on low-bandwidth networks, helping people stay connected across countries and devices.

